    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Roomble is a first-person social deduction where you solve puzzles online with other 3-11 players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out for trappers and their malicious schemes if you want to escape this ancient pyramid alive.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE AGENTS:</strong> Solve Puzles while you watch out so no one traps you puzzle sending you flying to your death.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b14f86cb0b42d6f2a1ed43ae2bba8877.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b14f86cb0b42d6f2a1ed43ae2bba8877.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b14f86cb0b42d6f2a1ed43ae2bba8877.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Win by solving all the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Communicate with each other to extinguish the Crisis schemed by the Trapper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Call emergency meetings to discuss and Vote to eject suspected Trappers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRAPPER:</strong> Use secret passages to prey on your victims, hide traps among their precious puzzle key items, and see them go BOOM! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/d0bba03a773d3eb8bb7db9e35d91cf12.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/d0bba03a773d3eb8bb7db9e35d91cf12.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/d0bba03a773d3eb8bb7db9e35d91cf12.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kill Agents by trapping key items before they use them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Help with the puzzles just enough to pass as a dutiful Agent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sneak through secret passages, spy, prey and scheme. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unleash a Crisis to create an extra dose of chaos among Agents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/6048765a52e1629afd73ec29ff77af68.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/6048765a52e1629afd73ec29ff77af68.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/6048765a52e1629afd73ec29ff77af68.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMERGENCY MEETING:</strong> Vote to get rid of your enemy - Meetings are a great place for unmasking the traitors, and also for framing the agents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/04ca274f5d85e8793c9c2d345875e167.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/04ca274f5d85e8793c9c2d345875e167.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/04ca274f5d85e8793c9c2d345875e167.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend to Play with friends. Rooms have been tested with up to 12 people.<br>Customize your character and join with friends to work-out puzzles together. The more the merrier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Built-in Voice Chat with Proximity Chat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Matchmaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Character roles. The Trapper and the Agent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lot of cosmetics to personalize your Exolotl with Hats, Chest pieces, Skirts, Pants... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seasonal Content with its own Season Pass. Current season is S1 Ancient Egypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSMETICS:\u00a0</strong>Customize your Exolotl with Reptile Skin Patterns, fun Tops and Bottoms and Full body disguises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community Discord to submit feedback and ideas, ask questions and find groups to play with!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/689f1e9e35da658b7659c4413c8b2f87.avif?t=1751485118\" /></span></p>",
