/video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend to Play with friends. Rooms have been tested with up to 12 people.<br>Customize your character and join with friends to work-out puzzles together. The more the merrier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/3f068f8304a2cb9db5534590102250a8.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Built-in Voice Chat with Proximity Chat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Matchmaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Character roles. The Trapper and the Agent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lot of cosmetics to personalize your Exolotl with Hats, Chest pieces, Skirts, Pants... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seasonal Content with its own Season Pass. Current season is S1 Ancient Egypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSMETICS:\u00a0</strong>Customize your Exolotl with Reptile Skin Patterns, fun Tops and Bottoms and Full body disguises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.poster.avif?t=1751485118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.webm?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/b46d4edeb0213243f365fc30b0674e1a.mp4?t=1751485118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community Discord to submit feedback and ideas, ask questions and find groups to play with!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521370/extras/689f1e9e35da658b7659c4413c8b2f87.avif?t=1751485118\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Sabotage, Set traps, Sneak through secret passages and lie to avoid expulsion, while up to other 3-11 players try to collaborate to solve the Escape Room challenges in this first person, multiplayer online, coop, Social Deduction game set in a procedurally generated Pyramid.",
